# ==============================================================================
# SupremeAI Monorepo: HYBRID GIT PROTECTION ARCHITECTURE
# Layer 1: Global Defense-in-Depth (Secrets, Build Artifacts, Dependencies, OS/IDE)
# Layer 2: Root Lockdown & Strict Allowlist (Blocks AI Scratchpad Injections)
# Layer 3: Subsystem Agility (Standard Tracking within Allowed Subdirectories)
# ==============================================================================

# ==============================================================================
# LAYER 1: 🛑 GLOBAL DEFENSE-IN-DEPTH (Applies Everywhere)
# ==============================================================================

